INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_comments` VALUES (1090,1232,'true_kwMl','ujbqnucvkMl@bystriy324andy.site','https://innerlighthouseapp.com/','89.124.112.117','2026-08-19 15:44:25','2026-08-19 21:44:25','Started using true fortune casino around six months ago when someone in another thread dropped the name, and not gonna lie I expected it\'d be yet another forgettable casinos that go quiet within weeks. Still here though, so that says something I suppose. \r\n \r\nGame selection is no joke huge — they claim over 2,500 titles going by the counter. NetEnt dominate my recents, so expect the ones everyone plays — Book of Dead swallows far too much of my time, and I\'ve had a couple of proper hits on Betsoft titles too. Microgaming the back catalogue is hidden behind the filters but they exist. \r\n \r\nLive dealer side is Evolution-run as far as I can tell, so it\'s fine by me. Crazy Time and Monopoly Live pull a fair few players around 8pm, dealers are real and chatty and the streams hold up on 4G. Sign-up offers came in at a match up to ?500 with 50 free spins, the rollover is 35x — standard, not generous. There was a tenner no-deposit during a promo week as well; these rotate quite a bit so  I\'d see what\'s running over on [url=https://innerlighthouseapp.com/]true fortune[/url] if you\'re thinking about it. \r\n \r\nYou can get in from a tenner last time I topped up, registration took maybe ten minutes with the ID upload. Mastercard goes through instantly, Skrill and Neteller are there and they do crypto now if that\'s your thing. Cashouts to Skrill took a day and a bit, card was slower. \r\n \r\nThe one thing that annoyed me: KYC flagged my first upload for no clear reason, which held up a withdrawal by a couple of days. Support fixed it eventually but it took two goes. Regulation side and I checked before depositing, so it\'s the first thing I check now. \r\n \r\nThey don\'t have an app as far as I found, just the mobile site — runs smooth on Android, though scrolling the lobby is a chore on mobile. Still got a balance sat there, and that says more than a rating would.',0,'0','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/129.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','comment',0,0);
