r stk-d5719af-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-d5719af-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/text {\"uniqueId\":\"fd4303e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-fd4303e\" data-block-id=\"fd4303e\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text\"><strong>Utensilios:</strong> Bowl mediano, tenedor, bandeja para horno y papel manteca (o un poquito de aceite de coco).</p></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/text -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Ingredientes:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 banano maduro.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 taza de avena en hojuelas (si podés licuarla un poco para que sea harina, mejor).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 huevo.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Procedimiento:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Horneá por <strong>15 minutos</strong> o hasta que estén doraditas. Dejá enfriar antes de dárselas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Precalentá el horno a 180°C.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>En el bowl, machacá el banano con el tenedor hasta que no tenga grumos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Agregá el huevo y mezclá bien; luego incorporá la avena poco a poco hasta tener una masa que no se pegue tanto a los dedos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hacé bolitas pequeñas y aplastalas en la bandeja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column --></details>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/accordion {\"uniqueId\":\"c75f651\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-stackable-accordion stk-block-accordion stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-block stk-c75f651 is-style-default\" data-block-id=\"c75f651\"><!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"ec93a96\",\"hasContainer\":true,\"htmlTag\":\"summary\",\"templateLock\":\"insert\",\"className\":\"stk\\u002d\\u002dcontainer-small stk-block-accordion__heading\"} -->\n<summary class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-ec93a96 stk--container-small stk-block-accordion__heading\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"ec93a96\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-ec93a96-container stk-hover-parent\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-ec93a96-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/icon-label {\"uniqueId\":\"b92a15c\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-icon-label stk-block-icon-label stk-block stk-b92a15c\" data-block-id=\"b92a15c\"><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content\"><!-- wp:stackable/heading {\"uniqueId\":\"7f61388\",\"hasP\":true,\"textTag\":\"h3\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-7f61388\" id=\"question-2-placeholder\" data-block-id=\"7f61388\"><h3 class=\"stk-block-heading__text\">Heladitos de Yogur y Manzana</h3></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/icon {\"uniqueId\":\"81cb8c2\",\"icon\":\"\\u003csvg data-prefix=\\u0022fas\\u0022 data-icon=\\u0022chevron-down\\u0022 class=\\u0022svg-inline\\u002d\\u002dfa fa-chevron-down fa-w-14\\u0022 xmlns=\\u0022http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 448 512\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cpath fill=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 d=\\u0022M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/path\\u003e\\u003c/svg\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-icon stk-block-icon stk-block stk-81cb8c2\" data-block-id=\"81cb8c2\"><span class=\"stk--svg-wrapper\"><div class=\"stk--inner-svg\"><svg style=\"height:0;width:0\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"linear-gradient-81cb8c2\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"100%\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-opacity:1;stop-color:var(--linear-gradient-81-cb-8-c-2-color-1)\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-opacity:1;stop-color:var(--linear-gradient-81-cb-8-c-2-color-2)\"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><svg data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"chevron-down\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down fa-w-14\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></div></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/icon --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/icon-label --></div></div></summary>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"a0c3dfa\",\"className\":\"stk-block-accordion__content\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-a0c3dfa stk-block-accordion__content\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"a0c3dfa\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-a0c3dfa-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-a0c3dfa-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/text {\"uniqueId\":\"3112fb5\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-3112fb5\" data-block-id=\"3112fb5\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text\"><strong>Utensilios:</strong> Molde para cubos de hielo (si tenés uno con forma de huesito o huella, queda de 10) y un cuchillo.</p></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/text -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Ingredientes:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 taza de yogur griego natural (SIN azúcar y SIN lactosa de preferencia).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 manzana roja.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Un chorrito de agua.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Procedimiento:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Metelo al congelador por al menos <strong>4 horas</strong>. ¡Y listo! Un premio refrescante y sano.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pelá la manzana y <strong>quitale todas las semillas</strong> (las semillas son tóxicas para ellos). Cortala en cuadritos bien chiquitos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mezclá el yogur con los trocitos de manzana y el chorrito de agua para que no quede tan espeso.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rellená el molde de cubitos de hielo con la mezcla.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column --></details>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/accordion {\"uniqueId\":\"1b0d514\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-stackable-accordion stk-block-accordion stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-block stk-1b0d514 is-style-default\" data-block-id=\"1b0d514\"><!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"ada8294\",\"hasContainer\":true,\"htmlTag\":\"summary\",\"templateLock\":\"insert\",\"className\":\"stk\\u002d\\u002dcontainer-small stk-block-accordion__heading\"} -->\n<summary class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-ada8294 stk--container-small stk-block-accordion__heading\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"ada8294\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-ada8294-container stk-hover-parent\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-ada8294-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/icon-label {\"uniqueId\":\"7176939\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-icon-label stk-block-icon-label stk-block stk-7176939\" data-block-id=\"7176939\"><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content\"><!-- wp:stackable/heading {\"uniqueId\":\"6724853\",\"hasP\":true,\"textTag\":\"h3\",\"metadata\":{\"blockVisibility\":false}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-6724853\" id=\"question-3-placeholder\" data-block-id=\"6724853\"><h3 class=\"stk-block-heading__text\">What are the pricing options involved?</h3></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/icon {\"uniqueId\":\"d96c8bb\",\"icon\":\"\\u003csvg data-prefix=\\u0022fas\\u0022 data-icon=\\u0022chevron-down\\u0022 class=\\u0022svg-inline\\u002d\\u002dfa fa-chevron-down fa-w-14\\u0022 xmlns=\\u0022http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 448 512\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cpath fill=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 d=\\u0022M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/path\\u003e\\u003c/svg\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-icon stk-block-icon stk-block stk-d96c8bb\" data-block-id=\"d96c8bb\"><span class=\"stk--svg-wrapper\"><div class=\"stk--inner-svg\"><svg style=\"height:0;width:0\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"linear-gradient-d96c8bb\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"100%\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-opacity:1;stop-color:var(--linear-gradient-d-96-c-8-bb-color-1)\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-opacity:1;stop-color:var(--linear-gradient-d-96-c-8-bb-color-2)\"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><svg data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"chevron-down\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down fa-w-14\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></div></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/icon --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/icon-label --></div></div></summary>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"e64044b\",\"className\":\"stk-block-accordion__content\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-e64044b stk-block-accordion__content\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"e64044b\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-e64044b-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-e64044b-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/text {\"uniqueId\":\"0308715\",\"metadata\":{\"blockVisibility\":false}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-0308715\" data-block-id=\"0308715\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text\">We offer several pricing options to suit different needs. You can view a detailed breakdown of our plans and features on our Pricing Page. We have a free tier, monthly subscriptions, and annual plans.</p></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/text --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column --></details>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/accordion --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"46bd7fb\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-46bd7fb\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"46bd7fb\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-46bd7fb-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-46bd7fb-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/accordion {\"uniqueId\":\"0d39b23\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-stackable-accordion stk-block-accordion stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-block stk-0d39b23 is-style-default\" data-block-id=\"0d39b23\"><!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"90cf1e5\",\"hasContainer\":true,\"htmlTag\":\"summary\",\"templateLock\":\"insert\",\"className\":\"stk\\u002d\\u002dcontainer-small stk-block-accordion__heading\"} -->\n<summary class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-90cf1e5 stk--container-small stk-block-accordion__heading\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"90cf1e5\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-90cf1e5-container stk-hover-parent\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-90cf1e5-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/icon-label {\"uniqueId\":\"f3eeeec\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-icon-label stk-block-icon-label stk-block stk-f3eeeec\" data-block-id=\"f3eeeec\"><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content\"><!-- wp:stackable/heading {\"uniqueId\":\"393e7b7\",\"hasP\":true,\"textTag\":\"h3\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-393e7b7\" id=\"question-4-placeholder\" data-block-id=\"393e7b7\"><h3 class=\"stk-block-heading__text\">Bocaditos de Atún</h3></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/icon {\"uniqueId\":\"0c86807\",\"icon\":\"\\u003csvg data-prefix=\\u0022fas\\u0022 data-icon=\\u0022chevron-down\\u0022 class=\\u0022svg-inline\\u002d\\u002dfa fa-chevron-down fa-w-14\\u0022 xmlns=\\u0022http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 448 512\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cpath fill=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 d=\\u0022M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/path\\u003e\\u003c/svg\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-icon stk-block-icon stk-block stk-0c86807\" data-block-id=\"0c86807\"><span class=\"stk--svg-wrapper\"><div class=\"stk--inner-svg\"><svg style=\"height:0;width:0\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"linear-gradient-0c86807\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"100%\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" style=\"stop-opacity:1;stop-color:var(--linear-gradient-0-c-86807-color-1)\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" style=\"stop-opacity:1;stop-color:var(--linear-gradient-0-c-86807-color-2)\"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><svg data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"chevron-down\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down fa-w-14\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></div></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/icon --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/icon-label --></div></div></summary>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"b1dff31\",\"className\":\"stk-block-accordion__content\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-b1dff31 stk-block-accordion__content\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"b1dff31\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-b1dff31-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-b1dff31-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/text {\"uniqueId\":\"05fae7b\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-05fae7b\" data-block-id=\"05fae7b\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text\"><strong>Utensilios:</strong> Bowl, colador, abrelatas y placa para horno.</p></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/text -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Ingredientes:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 lata de atún al natural (en agua, <strong>NUNCA</strong> en aceite ni con mucha sal).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1 huevo.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>media taza de harina de arroz (o avena molida).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Una pizca de catnip (opcional, para volverlos locos).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Procedimiento:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Horneá a 180°C por <strong>10 a 12 minutos</strong> hasta que estén firmes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Escurrí súper bien el atún con el colador hasta que quede seco.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mezclá el atún, el huevo y la harina en el bowl hasta crear una pasta uniforme.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Formá bolitas minúsculas (del tamaño de un chícharo/arveja) porque los gatos prefieren cosas pequeñas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column --></details>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/accordion {\"uniqueId\":\"58ce2bb\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-stackable-accordion stk-block-accordion stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-block stk-58ce2bb is-style-default\" data-block-id=\"58ce2bb\"><!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"9ab8600\",\"hasContainer\":true,\"htmlTag\":\"summary\",\"templateLock\":\"insert\",\"className\":\"stk\\u002d\\u002dcontainer-small stk-block-accordion__heading\"} -->\n<summary class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-9ab8600 stk--container-small stk-block-accordion__heading\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"9ab8600\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-9ab8600-container stk-hover-parent\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-9ab8600-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/icon-label {\"uniqueId\":\"b8394eb\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-icon-label stk-block-icon-label stk-block stk-b8394eb\" data-block-id=\"b8394eb\"><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content\"><!-- wp:stackable/heading {\"uniqueId\":\"2d00b24\",\"hasP\":true,\"textTag\":\"h3\",\"metadata\":{\"blockVisibility\":false}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-2d00b24\" id=\"question-5-placeholder\" data-block-id=\"2d00b24\"><h3 class=\"stk-block-heading__text\">What is your cancellation/refund policy?</h3></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/icon {\"uniqueId\":\"f3acc51\",\"icon\":\"\\u003csvg data-prefix=\\u0022fas\\u0022 data-icon=\\u0022chevron-down\\u0022 class=\\u0022svg-inline\\u002d\\u002dfa fa-chevron-down fa-w-14\\u0022 xmlns=\\u0022http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 448 512\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cpath fill=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 d=\\u0022M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/path\\u003e\\u003c/svg\\u003e\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-icon stk-block-icon stk-block stk-f3acc51\" data-block-id=\"f3acc51\"><span class=\"stk--svg-wrapper\"><div class=\"stk--inner-svg\"><s