73 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></div></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/icon --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/icon-label --></div></div></summary>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"de8c003\",\"className\":\"stk-block-accordion__content\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-de8c003 stk-block-accordion__content\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"de8c003\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-de8c003-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-de8c003-inner-blocks\"><!-- wp:stackable/text {\"uniqueId\":\"3502990\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-3502990\" data-block-id=\"3502990\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text\"><span style=\"color: var(--theme-palette-color-8, #ffffff);\" class=\"stk-highlight\">El tiempo de entrega estándar es de <strong>2 a 4 días hábiles</strong>. Una vez realizado el despacho, recibirás un número de seguimiento para monitorear tu paquete en tiempo real.</span></p></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/text --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/column --></details>\n<!-- /wp:stackable/accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:stackable/accordion {\"uniqueId\":\"58ce2bb\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-stackable-accordion stk-block-accordion stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-block stk-58ce2bb is-style-default\" data-block-id=\"58ce2bb\"><!-- wp:stackable/column {\"uniqueId\":\"c82b937\",\"hasContainer\":true,\"htmlTag\":\"summary\",\"templateLock\":\"insert\",\"className\":\"stk\\u002d\\u002dcontainer-small stk-block-accordion__heading\"} -->\n<summary class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-c82b937 stk--container-small stk-block-accordion__heading\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"c82b937\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper st